{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5629, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4690, "text": "Hey, guys."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 7650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5630, "text": "Hey. Hi. Guess where we've been."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8189, "text": "A really bad plastic surgeon?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12370, "text": "No, we took little Charlie to the\ncircus."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 18330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15470, "text": "The circus, Knicks games, Chinatown."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 21270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18630, "text": "You two sure have been hanging out a lot\ntogether lately."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 25150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21570, "text": "Yeah, and having such a good time. So\nmany great things to do in New York. You"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 27250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25150, "text": "mean besides run, scream, and reload?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 36760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34320, "text": "Isn't this a glorious night?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 41680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39580, "text": "Look out, here comes Brother Teresa."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 50360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43440, "text": "The spirit of giving envelops me. The\nrapture of humanity engulfs me. The"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 54560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50360, "text": "tenor of altruism fills every out of my\nbeing."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 58940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55920, "text": "I bring to you the future."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 61260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59680, "text": "Wow, and it all fits in there."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 66740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64500, "text": "No, my beloved Dunst."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 73760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68240, "text": "We have just broken ground on the Phil\nSanders Memorial Free Clinic."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 77840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74660, "text": "Gee, Dan, I hate to nitpick, but you\nshould have spent a few more bucks and"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 78860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77840, "text": "built a life -size one."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 84140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81980, "text": "Dan, you're building a free clinic."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 90540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84400, "text": "No, my angel. It is Phil who guides me.\nIt is he whose foundation has made it"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 91540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90540, "text": "possible."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 93840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91920, "text": "If only he had lived long enough."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 95400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94400, "text": "To die in it."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 99240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98080, "text": "Well, I'm convinced."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 101680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100020, "text": "That's not our Dan."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 103740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102380, "text": "I've read about things like this."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 107640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 104460, "text": "Extraterrestrial beings made to look\nlike people we know so they can take"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 108780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107640, "text": "the whole planet."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 114340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112360, "text": "I'll bet their plan is to kidnap us."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 116320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114760, "text": "One by one."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 122500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120580, "text": "They'll probably take him for their zoo."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 131000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129100, "text": "I got my key. I got mine."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 134540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133360, "text": "Open for business!"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 143380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140120, "text": "Gee, honey, this is a great surprise,\nbut I can't stay."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 144780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143580, "text": "I gotta track Dan."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 146380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145180, "text": "I think he's from Mars."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 152040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148720, "text": "Oh, don't stop. He proved my landlord\nwas from Jupiter."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 153540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152380, "text": "Oh, how did he do that?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 156820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153740, "text": "Well, he dangled him by his ankles from\nthe roof until he fessed up."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 161380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159359, "text": "Matt, maybe we should keep an eye on\nBall."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 163700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 161860, "text": "Yeah, and lock the door to the roof."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 171160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166500, "text": "I thought they would never leave. Great\nnews, girls. This matchmaker has found"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 173000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171160, "text": "the catch of the century."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 174700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173400, "text": "Any takers?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 178280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 175100, "text": "I'm sorry, Wanda, but for the first time\nsince my divorce, I'm finally feeling"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 180620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178280, "text": "good. No matter how great he is, I'm not\nready."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 182260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181180, "text": "And I'm not interested."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 185500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182680, "text": "Oh, now, before you make up your minds,\nlet me tell you about him."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 192120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 186040, "text": "Sensual lips, deep mysterious eyes, and\na butt that just won't quit."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 195760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194600, "text": "Won't quit, huh?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 198680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197340, "text": "I thought you weren't interested."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 200740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199120, "text": "Huh? I'm not."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 202480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201060, "text": "I am."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 205620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202680, "text": "Oh, great. I'll set you up. Not so fast."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 208820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206000, "text": "I'm not real comfortable with this butt\npart."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 213200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 209780, "text": "Why? I've never dated a smoker before."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 261240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258320, "text": "$50 in time served, and that's lunch."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 262740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261740, "text": "Uh, Kitty?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 266260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265140, "text": "Let me pay your veil."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 268960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267140, "text": "What do I have to do for the 50 bucks?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 272880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271880, "text": "Nothing."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 275020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274020, "text": "Nothing?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 277020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276000, "text": "Feel me, I'm touched."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 279060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277860, "text": "You've inspired me."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 283100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279940, "text": "Yes, I'm going back to school and finish\nmy doctorate."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 289520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288360, "text": "definitely from another planet."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 293460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290520, "text": "I'm gonna go check out his office for\nunusual -looking pods."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 298800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295340, "text": "Dan, you've had an interesting approach\nto the prosecution tonight."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 299959, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299180, "text": "What's up?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 304480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299960, "text": "Well, you've gotten four cases\ndismissed, and you've given out over"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 307120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304480, "text": "money. Isn't it wonderful, Harry?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 313360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308700, "text": "Oh, helping those who deserve it.\nOpening soup kitchens, opening free"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 315680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313620, "text": "So many causes, so little time."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 318890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316260, "text": "With any luck... We'll have the common\ncold licked by July."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 324850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 321690, "text": "You know, maybe the bald guy's right."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 329370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326790, "text": "Hey, Harry, I got the pictures back from\nthe bike trip."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 330610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329610, "text": "Oh, that was fun."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 332390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330890, "text": "I hadn't been on a bicycle in years."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 334550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332670, "text": "Well, there you are getting on. Yeah."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 337630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335210, "text": "Oh, and here you are doing the handstand\non the handlebars."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 342110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339370, "text": "Oh, and here's that nice man that helped\nsnap your shoulder back in place."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 350660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345520, "text": "Good news, Lisette, your Romeo will meet\nyou in 15 minutes in the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 353840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351320, "text": "Oh, great, my Romeo."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 357400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355280, "text": "Oh, no, Ros, will you go with me?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 359700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357960, "text": "Why? I'm scared."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 361880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360040, "text": "What if he gets fresh?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 363420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362420, "text": "In the cafeteria?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 365680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363860, "text": "Nothing's been fresh in there for years."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 370360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368580, "text": "Please, please, pretty please."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 374260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371060, "text": "Oh, all right. I hate it when you whine."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 380260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379120, "text": "on Lisette and her date."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 384840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380500, "text": "Oh, Harry, that's so childish, so\nimmature. So what are we waiting for?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 388980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386720, "text": "Just build."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 390860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389420, "text": "Don't worry about the cost."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 394400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391280, "text": "Nothing is too good for those who have\nnothing, Vinnie."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 396820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394880, "text": "We have to change the world."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 404260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400100, "text": "Phil, doing good is wonderful."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 406420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405220, "text": "It's better than sex."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 409510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407790, "text": "It's better than sex with the Lander\nsisters."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 413190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412190, "text": "Oh!"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 417190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416190, "text": "Oh!"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 419310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417590, "text": "Oh, you wonderful people!"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 421770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420770, "text": "Here!"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 425310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424290, "text": "Enjoy today!"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 428550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426070, "text": "Have faith and hope for tomorrow!"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 436170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434190, "text": "Phil, if you could only be here to see\nthis."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 439990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438310, "text": "Finally, my life has purpose."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 446430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441030, "text": "But, look, if you don't think that I'm\ndoing enough, just, well, send me a"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 447770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446510, "text": "I'll do even more."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 449550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448550, "text": "Hiya, Dan."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 453250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452250, "text": "That's some sign."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 462150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455170, "text": "Love is in the air, and"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 467030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462150, "text": "your date is in the hall. Here is the\nman that may share your shower cap."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 468610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467390, "text": "Your mystery date."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 469910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468910, "text": "Ta -da!"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 475850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472670, "text": "And that's what I call a dream boat."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 478870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477870, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 482870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481010, "text": "That's what I call an ex -husband."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 493690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491410, "text": "Tony is Christine's ex?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 495350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494190, "text": "Yes, ex."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 496790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495650, "text": "As in ex."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 503920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497740, "text": "bad to date oh why are all the cute guys\nmy friend's ex -husband"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 508640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503920, "text": "come on let's go down to the dock and\nhit on some sailors"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 515440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508640, "text": "you know i usually take a powder when\nthese things"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 517200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515440, "text": "don't work out bye"}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 527330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525250, "text": "Well, this sure is some kind of crazy\nmix -up, isn't it?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 528850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527850, "text": "Is it?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 532590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529290, "text": "Yeah, you see, I met Wanda, and she told\nme she was a matchmaker. Then she said"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 536270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532590, "text": "that there was this gorgeous woman down\nat the courthouse, so I just assumed."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 542430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537770, "text": "You see, the thing is, Sullivan, I,\nuh... How you doing, Harry?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 545230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544230, "text": "Fine."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 548650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547650, "text": "And busy."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 552550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549370, "text": "Got a mountain of paperwork that I\nshould get right on."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 554730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553730, "text": "Right now."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 562050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560930, "text": "Tony, what's this all about?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 566450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562770, "text": "Sullivan, I've been doing a lot of\nthinking since we broke up. Oh, picking"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 567450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566450, "text": "new hobby?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 570890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569170, "text": "You're right. I deserve that."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 573070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571510, "text": "But, Sullivan, I miss you."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 574990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573570, "text": "I miss our life together."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 577250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576230, "text": "I want to try again."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 583770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580070, "text": "Tony, it's taken me a long time to get\nover us. I've been through a lot, but"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 584549, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583770, "text": "finally there."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 585550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584550, "text": "I can't go back."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 587730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586150, "text": "But, Sullivan, I've changed."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 591940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588460, "text": "I promise you I won't make the same\nmistakes again. Well, good. Then you"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 593480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 591940, "text": "to be able to use that in your next\nrelationship."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 596840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594660, "text": "This is going to be my next\nrelationship."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 600660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 598920, "text": "Christine, I love you."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 602720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601280, "text": "And I know you still love me."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 605120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603780, "text": "I am going to get you back again."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 625360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624360, "text": "Italian soup."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 628260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626600, "text": "This is good."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 631720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629860, "text": "Dan, I'm not Phil."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 633320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 632320, "text": "I'm Will."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 635660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633580, "text": "Will Sanders, Phil's brother."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 637220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 636220, "text": "Who?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 639580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637840, "text": "He never mentioned me?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 641920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640920, "text": "Not a word."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 645740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642960, "text": "My God, you're the spitting image, the\nhair, the face."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 650560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 646360, "text": "Although the smell is more like old\nspice, Phil was more like old cabbage."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 653260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651700, "text": "Philip was, uh..."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 662640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656099, "text": "Distinctive. You know, in the old days,\nwhen we'd lunch at the Four Seasons, I'd"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 666420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662640, "text": "order from the menu while Phil would\nroot through the trash for leftovers."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 670820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668280, "text": "Well, back then, we just thought he was\neccentric."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 674380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671500, "text": "We didn't know he was planning on\nturning it into a lifestyle."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 679480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678400, "text": "This is unbelievable."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 682740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680280, "text": "I mean, I asked for a sign."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 684820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683820, "text": "You are."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 690040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685120, "text": "I wanted to come back as soon as I heard\nthe horrible news about the piano"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 694380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690040, "text": "accident. But I was in South America\nfinishing up a project for the Phil"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 698380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694380, "text": "Foundation. I was planting rainforests."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 702600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700400, "text": "Planting rainforests."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 705080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704080, "text": "Bless you."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 710440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709320, "text": "I still..."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 713640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711560, "text": "Can't believe my beloved brother is\ngone."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 718380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715940, "text": "He was my inspiration, Dan."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 723000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719560, "text": "He changed my life and gave it meaning."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 727320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724040, "text": "Before that, I walked in a path of\ndarkness."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 728960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727960, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 730960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729500, "text": "I was a womanizer."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 733220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732220, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 737140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734520, "text": "I was evil. No."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 740440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738520, "text": "But then... Then..."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 742530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740910, "text": "You saw the light? Yes."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 745450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742870, "text": "And the light was beautiful."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 750410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745990, "text": "Yes, you've seen it too. Oh, and I have\nfelt its power."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 754270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750830, "text": "Dan, Phil was my general in the fight\nfor goodness."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 756330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754630, "text": "I was his foot soldier."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 761150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759030, "text": "Let me be your foot soldier."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 763550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762070, "text": "Let me help you."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 766230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764430, "text": "Let me walk in the light."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 769750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768170, "text": "I would be so..."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 775140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771640, "text": "Honored. Someone who understands."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 782220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776120, "text": "There's so much to be done. I know, Dan,\nbut we can do it together just as I did"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 783220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782220, "text": "with Phil."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 789380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784460, "text": "You know, over the years, we turned the\nfund into a multi -million dollar"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 790380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789380, "text": "charity."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 794380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790700, "text": "Phil had the light and I had the know\n-how."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 796520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795140, "text": "What kind of know -how?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 797920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796920, "text": "Financial."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 801820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799020, "text": "You have made some financial plans,\nhaven't you?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 804420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802220, "text": "I ordered checks with halos on them."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 808900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806860, "text": "Long -range planning."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 810660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809420, "text": "A wise investment."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 812680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811320, "text": "Regeneration of funds."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 819720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814280, "text": "Now, Dan, imagine the heartbreak if we\nhad no more to give."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 823180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820400, "text": "The fund must be replenished."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 825840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823780, "text": "What did you plan to do when the well\nran dry?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 828340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827340, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 830970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828970, "text": "I guess I hope for some miracle."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 836130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832490, "text": "Ben, I am that miracle."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 841130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840130, "text": "Hallelujah."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 847710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845670, "text": "Well, you're not going to believe this\none."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 850950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848430, "text": "Tony wants to get back together again.\nIs that a hoot or what?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 854140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851480, "text": "That's better than a hoot at the howl.\nYeah, right."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 857160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854380, "text": "Like, I'm going to spend six months\ngetting over him just to take him back."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 860240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857320, "text": "Really? Why don't you just call the IRS\nand beg them to audit you?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 866040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861680, "text": "Yes, sirree, Bob. My relationship with\nTony is as dead as Phil."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 867680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866680, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 871600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870600, "text": "Christine,"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 875840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871880, "text": "once again, grace shines upon me. I want\nyou to meet Phil's brother, Will."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 881180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876520, "text": "Like manna from heaven, he has been sent\nto help me. We are going to invest and"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 884380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881180, "text": "build and herald the joy of giving\ntogether."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 888960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887180, "text": "Hi, Will. I'm Harry Stone."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 891200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889180, "text": "It's nice to meet you. My pleasure, I'm\nsure."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 895180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894180, "text": "Hi, Dan."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 896580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895580, "text": "Hi, Bull."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 898200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896740, "text": "Come on. I'll show you around."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 902660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901600, "text": "Bull, what are you doing?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 905260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903300, "text": "I'm taking his hair in for chemical\nanalysis."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 912260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906140, "text": "And I haven't got a minute to waste. It\nappears this alien can raise and groom"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 913260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912260, "text": "the dead."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 918700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916960, "text": "Another delivery for Christine."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 923980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919800, "text": "I'd say either Tony is wild about you or\nhe bought stock in FTD."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 928000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925880, "text": "Oh, so he sent a few flowers."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 929300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928300, "text": "A few?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 931600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929420, "text": "You'd have to die twice to get that\nmany."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 935580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934380, "text": "You want to put these in water?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 937200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936140, "text": "Yeah, like the East River."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 939140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937980, "text": "Can I take a hint?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 943640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941640, "text": "Well, I got the results on Dan's hair."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 947780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944100, "text": "He's either human or from a planet that\nhas our exact pH balance and uses"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 948780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947780, "text": "styling mousse."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 952760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950900, "text": "Well, I guess that proves he's human."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 954480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953480, "text": "Human, yes."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 956340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954860, "text": "American? Maybe not."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 961280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958600, "text": "I bet he's a foreign agent pretending to\nbe Dan."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 966660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963220, "text": "I bet he's an overgrown turnip\npretending to be a bailiff."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 971640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970640, "text": "Dasvidaniya, comrade."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 974220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972460, "text": "Sure. See you, Bull."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 978920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976080, "text": "Another KGB plot to take over the 18th\nfloor."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 980940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979500, "text": "I must alert all bailiffs."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 985220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983000, "text": "Excuse me. Have you got the time,\nplease?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 990120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989120, "text": "Gee, thanks."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 996170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994990, "text": "You gave her your gold watch."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1001650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997010, "text": "Mack, material possession is nothing\nwhen compared to the needs of others."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1005650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002450, "text": "Speaking of others, I haven't seen Will\naround."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1009650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006150, "text": "He's out making some foundation\ninvestments. I've given him $100 ,000."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1011890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010030, "text": "He's going to double it."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1015510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012250, "text": "You gave a total stranger $100 ,000?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1018730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015790, "text": "Don't you think that's a little risky,\ngiving that kind of money to somebody"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1019730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018730, "text": "hardly know?"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1022630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020190, "text": "Mack, ye of little faith."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1025819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023370, "text": "Man. You're overstressed."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1027680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026060, "text": "Take some time off."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1029940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027880, "text": "Call one of your four -star girlfriends."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1033240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031960, "text": "Perish the thought."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1040839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034119, "text": "I am ridding myself of every last\nvestige and relic of the old"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1046980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040839, "text": "Dan Fielding, including this directory\nof debauchery."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1052060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050500, "text": "You're throwing away your black book?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1054940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052680, "text": "This is the path which led me to evil."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1059660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056140, "text": "This is the path which will lead me to\nsalvation."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1068040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061160, "text": "Well, thank you very much."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1071520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068380, "text": "We got them. Two seats, front row,\nmezzanine."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1074480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071780, "text": "Wow, the 10 ,000th performance of Cats."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1078560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075220, "text": "Can't wait to see it again. The last\ntime I went, the rum -tum tugger choked"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1079560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078560, "text": "a hairball."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1084950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082250, "text": "You know, these last few weeks have been\na lot of fun."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1089050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085410, "text": "I guess it's great that our lives both\ncrashed at the same time."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1090990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089990, "text": "You know what I mean."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1093070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091330, "text": "It's been really nice being with you."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1095250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093350, "text": "Yeah. I've liked being with you, too."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1098990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095530, "text": "Well, not being with you, but like\nfriends."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1100950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099670, "text": "It's been really special for me."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1102210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101210, "text": "For me, too."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1107250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103730, "text": "Another package from your left -in\n-secret admirer. Oh, no."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1108910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107530, "text": "When is this guy going to get the\nmessage?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1112060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109660, "text": "It's too small for flowers. Maybe he\njust sent seeds."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1123400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117600, "text": "Well, don't they look like the happy\ncouple?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1126440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124760, "text": "They were when they were on my wedding\ncake."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1131960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128720, "text": "And that was the week that was, folks.\nSee you Monday."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1134560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133560, "text": "Just a second."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1137700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134840, "text": "No more park benches for you tonight.\nYou stay at the Ritz."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1139930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138590, "text": "Oh, out of cash. Wait, here."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1141950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140810, "text": "Take my credit card."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1146290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144930, "text": "Did you see that?"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1147630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146630, "text": "I think so."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1151210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148850, "text": "Somebody's got to talk to him, Harry.\nHe's not Will."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1153990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151550, "text": "He's handing out money like he's\nRockefeller."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1157310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154290, "text": "Will disappears with $100 ,000. He\ndoesn't even blink."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1161750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158210, "text": "You're right. We've got to bring him\ndown to Earth before he sprouts a halo."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1164050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162150, "text": "Dan? Yes, Harry?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1168840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165520, "text": "We know you've been working hard on the\nPhil Foundation, but we think you might"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1170260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168840, "text": "be getting a little carried away."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1171880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170880, "text": "Yes, you're right."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1175920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172300, "text": "Carried away with all the joy and faith\nthat's in my heart."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1177460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176280, "text": "It's orgasmic."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1183760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178360, "text": "Maybe all this faith and joy and other\nstuff is getting in the way of good"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1184760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183760, "text": "judgment."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1187220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186220, "text": "Macintosh."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1189940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187640, "text": "Dad, you need help, pal."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1193300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190280, "text": "All the help I need I have in will."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1195720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194399, "text": "Somebody better get a net."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1200500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197500, "text": "Dan, I think you better consider the\nfact that Will may not be coming back."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1202060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200960, "text": "Of course he will."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1203460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202320, "text": "Or maybe he won't."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1205640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203800, "text": "Will won't. No."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1207600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206200, "text": "Will. Hi, Dan."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1211820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208660, "text": "I'm sorry I couldn't get back any\nsooner. You must have been worried."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1213360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1212120, "text": "Not for a second, brother."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1215540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214280, "text": "Um, about the money."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1217600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216160, "text": "I'm sorry I didn't double it."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1219100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218100, "text": "Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1220580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219580, "text": "I, um..."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1222260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221260, "text": "Tripled it."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1225180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223800, "text": "Another miracle."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1227240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225780, "text": "Can I have a hallelujah?"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1235980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231700, "text": "Wow. I guess your faith paid off. It\nalways does."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1241720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238260, "text": "Can you hold this a sec? Sure."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1242980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241980, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1251130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250090, "text": "Now I got his fingerprints."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1253930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252930, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1255650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254490, "text": "will you give it a rest?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1258310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256310, "text": "Dan's not an alien and he's not a spy."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1263110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258710, "text": "He may be weird, but he's the exact same\nDan Fielding you've been seeing every"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1264370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263110, "text": "day for eight years."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1265930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264930, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1270110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266890, "text": "It all makes sense now. He's exactly the\nsame because he's a clone."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1273890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272130, "text": "They had to build from actual tissue."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1276710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274730, "text": "I'm going to see if you left any dead\nskin lying around."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1281870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279950, "text": "So, Harry, you want to join me for a\nbeer?"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1285430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282230, "text": "Well, you know, I would love to suck\nsuds with you, pal, but I can't."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1289590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286230, "text": "I'm taking Christine to see cats. We got\ntwo in the litter box."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1295330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292550, "text": "And on that lovely note, I bid you good\nnight."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1299850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298550, "text": "Hey. Oh, Harry."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1304730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1300690, "text": "I can't believe this, but I need to talk\nto Tony to straighten things out."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1309440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305210, "text": "Now? Yeah, I'm feeling a little\nconfused. I think maybe if I sit down"}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1313000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309440, "text": "face to face... We weren't supposed to\ndo something, were we?"}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1314900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313700, "text": "No, no, it's okay."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1316560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315560, "text": "See you later."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1324900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323840, "text": "This is spectacular!"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1331460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328640, "text": "If you could do this with a hundred\nthousand, think what you could do!"}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1334040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331720, "text": "Six million? Think what it would mean to\nthe Foundation."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1338940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334280, "text": "We could expand, help more people, and\nstay in the black."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1341240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339240, "text": "Oh, Phil's dream would live forever."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1343100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341540, "text": "That would be glorious."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1349640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344500, "text": "Will, I would like to take you on the\nPhil Foundation in a permanent capacity,"}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1351260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349760, "text": "if you're interested."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1354620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351660, "text": "Oh, nothing on earth would mean more to\nme, Brother Dan."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1357200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356200, "text": "That's wonderful."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1361940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357980, "text": "Listen, why don't we take a ride down to\nthe clinic site? I want you in on every"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1364820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361940, "text": "decision. I'd love that. Okay, good.\nWait right here. I'll just get my"}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1365820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364820, "text": "briefcase."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1383360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382360, "text": "Sammy?"}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1385320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1384320, "text": "Will."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1386620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1385500, "text": "He bought it. We're in."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1388940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1387400, "text": "I'll meet you in Rio in two weeks."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1391860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1390100, "text": "And, uh, Sammy, book me a suite."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1395660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1392460, "text": "I want to have lots of room to enjoy\nFielding's millions."}
